{"4321420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Itemized TD", "steam_appid": 4321420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Defense - What's different?<br><br>A splash tower, a frost tower, plus some single target towers, and you are good right? - Think again.<br><br>Figure out how to create a strategic build/setup using function defining items plus skill nodes. Without this, you won't make it all the way.<br><br>Additionally you have more control over the skills towers gain, and need to fine-tune your setup for maximum effect.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Defense - What's different?<br><br>A splash tower, a frost tower, plus some single target towers, and you are good right? - Think again.<br><br>Figure out how to create a strategic build/setup using function defining items plus skill nodes. Without this, you won't make it all the way.<br><br>Additionally you have more control over the skills towers gain, and need to fine-tune your setup for maximum effect.</p>", "short_description": "Build broken tower synergies through loot and skill tree. Discover gameplay-shifting items and build defining skill nodes that radically reshape your strategy. Experiment, pivot, and stack powerful interactions. Finding tailored synergies to dominate the varied challenges are essential.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321420/8f82c66e84c39f8d30cf558b318e7cb97b87b8ce/header.jpg?t=1788160750", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321420/e436dda65a6af3d348baf91d4f3a7dd4471118e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788160750", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4321420/e436dda65a6af3d348baf91d4f3a7dd4471118e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788160750", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><b